(HELIOS CAPITAL PARTNERS) Tj T*
(Quarterly investor memo, Q3 2024 \(period ended September 30, 2024\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Fund performance) Tj T*
(Fund IV reports a net IRR of 14.7% since inception and a net multiple of 1.62x.) Tj T*
(The management fee is 1.85% of committed capital during the investment period.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Portfolio highlights) Tj T*
(Brightwell Logistics reported an EBITDA margin of 23.4% for the quarter.) Tj T*
(Brightwell revenue grew 11% year over year to $412 million.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Macro backdrop) Tj T*
(Rates remain the main headwind. The 10-year Treasury yield ended the quarter at) Tj T*
(4.9%, up sharply from June, and we expect refinancing costs to stay elevated.) Tj T*
(The Federal Reserve held its policy rate unchanged at its September 2024 meeting.) Tj T*
